sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Login as Login.tsx
    participant WordCaptcha as WordCaptchaField
    participant Axios
    participant Middleware
    participant Java as WordCaptchaService

    User->>Login: open /login
    Login->>WordCaptcha: mount (if LOGIN_WORD_CAPTCHA_REQUIRED)
    WordCaptcha->>Axios: GET /auth/captcha/challenge
    Axios->>Middleware: GET /api/v1/auth/captcha/challenge
    Middleware->>Java: GET /auth/captcha/challenge
    Java->>Java: createChallenge() — 5 chars, SVG, 10min TTL
    Java-->>WordCaptcha: challengeId + svg
    User->>WordCaptcha: type 5 characters (case-insensitive)
    WordCaptcha->>Login: captchaToken challengeId plus answer
